---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 mt-auto border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      
      <!-- Company Overview -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide flex items-center">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-6 bg-sky-500 rounded-sm mr-3 inline-block"></span>
          {siteConfig.companyName}
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          仰發科技成立於西元2007年，為專業半導體及電子零件代理經銷商。專營功率元件、MOSFET、電容、LED 及第三代半導體相關 IC 產品，深耕台灣並積極佈局大中華市場。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Navigation -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-white tracking-wider uppercase">網站導覽</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          {siteConfig.navItems.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <a 
                href={item.href} 
                class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors duration-200 inline-flex items-center"
              >
                <span class="text-sky-500 mr-2">›</span>
                {item.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact Info -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-white tracking-wider uppercase">聯絡資訊</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-400 mr-2.5 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
            <a 
              href={siteConfig.mapUrl} 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
              class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors"
              title="開啟 Google 地圖"
            >
              {siteConfig.address}
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-400 mr-2.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
            </svg>
            <a href={`tel:${siteConfig.phone}`} class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">
              電話：{siteConfig.phone}
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-400 mr-2.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 8h10M7 12h4m1 8l-4-4H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-3l-4 4z" />
            </svg>
            <span>傳真：{siteConfig.fax}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-400 mr-2.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
            <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">
              {siteConfig.email}
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-sm text-slate-400 space-y-4 sm:space-y-0">
      <p>2026 仰發科技有限公司版權所有</p>
      <div class="flex space-x-6">
        <span class="hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">企業社會責任</span>
        <span class="hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">隱私權政策</span>
        <span class="hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">服務條款</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
